    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000502/1010005020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "あすみ",
    "text": "うん、グループでやるみたい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "あすみ",
    "text": "もうパートが決まってて、各自練習してきたものを\r\n当日合わせて発表するって感じで──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "se": "2391"
  },
  {
